2 CONT Giovanna Bassi (1762–1834) was an Italian ballerina who spent the majority of her career in Sweden. She was regarded as the prima donna of the Swedish Ballet during the Gustavian age.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://juliaherdman.com/2017/05/02/giovanna-bassi-ballet-dancer-mother-and-spy/
