1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Saddlemaker at Drottningholm in Stockholm. Lived at Eldgarn in Färentuna Parish and later at his fathers place Westertorp in Färentuna Parish. He bought this place from his father. Later on he sold Westertorp and m
2 CONC oved to Söderhamn in the county of Helsingland. In 1838 he bought a farm in Ina, Söderala Parish just outside of Söderhamn. He returned to Färentuna in 1845. He died Feb. 27, 1858 in smallpox at Ölsta, Färentuna Parish and his bur
2 CONC ried at the Färentuna curch cemetary. His wife Margareta became a follower to Erik Jansson. In 1846 she and the four children emigrated together with other "jansoniter" to America.
