2 CONT
2 CONT ALDO Louis Utke Rasmussen, *1884-11-06, f 1933-05-18. Civilingeniør. Antaget navnet Utkov. 1919-05-17 ~ EVELYN Anna Elisabeth baronesse Walleen, *1893-10-10 i London. 1 datter.
